      ],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>Buying a gift for a man can feel like negotiating with someone who refuses to name a ransom. You ask what he wants and get a shrug and a \"I really don't need anything.\" He will not send a link, he will not drop a hint, and he will absolutely clock it if a gift card shows up again. Which leaves you where you are every year: in a store with a deadline and no plan. </p><p>Here is the case for cologne. He would never spend the money on himself, he will use it every morning, and it refreshes a corner of his routine he stopped thinking about years ago. The only real work is matching the scent to the man instead of grabbing whatever is stacked highest at the counter. So let's make it easy and go by the guy you are shopping for. Each pick is a Scentspired bestseller made with high-quality, Swiss-sourced fragrance oil, the thing that keeps a scent going all day rather than fading out before his second coffee.</p>"
      }
    },
