      ],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>Some guys wear the same three colognes as everyone else in the room and never question it. This one is not that guy. He has opinions on coffee roasters and knows the name of his barber’s other clients. Eternal Verde suits him. Inspired by Hacivat by Nishane, it opens with crisp pineapple and bergamot over a green, woody heart that feels fresh, grown-up and never obvious.</p><p>A <a href=\"/collections/men\" title=\"Men\">best cologne for men</a> who like to sit a step off the beaten path, this one gets the \"wait, what is that?\" reaction more than almost anything else in the range. It has real character and is still easy to wear on a regular day. Give it to the guy who prides himself on finding things before everyone else does.</p>"
      }
    },
