    "blogtextliquid_Mwe9Xw": {
      "type": "blogtextliquid",
      "custom_css": [
        "@media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {.shopify-hardcoded-text-section-content {font-size: 24px !important; margin: 0 !important; } .shopify-hardcoded-text-section-wrapper {margin-bottom: -85px; }}",
        ".shopify-hardcoded-text-section-content {font-size: 16px; margin-left: 0px; text-align: left;}",
        "@media screen and (max-width: 1024px) {.shopify-hardcoded-text-section-wrapper {min-height: 200px; padding: 16px !important; }}"
      ],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>Maybe things are new with someone, or it is a coworker in the office exchange, or a brother-in-law you like but could not really describe. When his taste is a mystery, you want something rich and easy to love that does not gamble on a specific preference. Silk Odyssey fits. Inspired by Oud Satin Mood by Maison Francis Kurkdjian, it is a plush blend of rose, oud and vanilla that feels genuinely luxurious and never overpowering. </p><p>It leans unisex, which takes the pressure off guessing, and it has a smooth, warm depth that suits just about anyone. A luxury inspired perfume that reads as thoughtful and a little special, and a safe bet that still feels like you put real care into it.</p>"
      }
    },
    "blocks_g6VtBW": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_19f144a_BAgRLn": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_19f144a",
          "settings": {
            "line_1_text": "Why it beats",
            "line_1_alignment": "left",
            "line_1_offset": 195,
            "line_2_text": "another gift card,",
            "line_2_alignment": "center",
            "line_2_offset": 0,
            "line_3_text": "every time",
            "line_3_alignment": "right",
            "line_3_offset": -235,
            "body_text": "<p>A fragrance works as a gift for one reason: he would never buy it himself. Most men wear one bottle down to the last drop and never think to upgrade. Give him a scent that performs like the designer original, at around twenty dollars a bottle, and he gets to wear the good stuff on a regular weekday instead of saving it for a special occasion that keeps not happening. Cologne is made to be worn, not kept on a shelf for best.</p>",
            "line_1_size": 40,
            "line_2_size": 50,
