            "heading_line_spacing": 4,
            "heading_line_height": 1,
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "body_text": "So, the next time you are staring down a wall of bottles with no clue where to begin, stop guessing. Choose the man, choose the scent, and let it carry the message for you. Browse the full Scentspired collection to shop for cologne online, find his match, and give him something he will reach for first thing tomorrow.",
